  m_Name: Documentation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _markdownContent: '# Pixel Platformer


    A mini platformer with player, enemies,
    pickups, levels, etc.


    **NOTE: Add Scenes to Build Settings to load the
    next level when completed.**


    {height=300}![screenshot](Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker/Editor/Addons/Packages/com.hutonggames.playmaker.samples.pixel-platformer.jpg)


    ##
    Features


    - Uses Input and 2d Physics to control the player.

    - Sync
    animator parameters to player state.

    - Collect pickups.

    - Traps that
    kill the player.

    - Enemies with patrol routes.

    - Respawn player when
    killed.

    - One way and falling platforms.

    - Detect level cleared and
    load next level.

'
